  "id": "visualspatial-ability",
  "term": "visual–spatial ability",
  "definition": "Visual–spatial ability is a set of cognitive skills for understanding and mentally working with spatial features such as distance and direction. It includes abilities like perceiving spatial relationships, visualizing spatial arrangements, and mentally rotating objects.",
